---
// Open Source AI Stack Blueprint Architecture Diagram
---

<figure class="stack-diagram" aria-labelledby="stack-caption">
  <svg
    class="stack-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 960 460"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="stack-title stack-desc"
  >
    <title id="stack-title">端到端開源 AI 技術棧全景架構藍圖</title>
    <desc id="stack-desc">
      展示開源 AI 技術棧的四大核心層級：推理服務 (vLLM/Ollama)、向量資料庫
      (Qdrant/Milvus)、Agent 工作流編排 (LangGraph)，以及可觀測性與評測
      (Langfuse)。
    </desc>

    <defs>
      <marker
        id="stack-arrow"
        viewBox="0 0 10 10"
        refX="8"
        refY="5"
        markerWidth="7"
        markerHeight="7"
        orient="auto"
      >
        <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" class="stack-diagram__arrow-head"
        ></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>

    <!-- Column 1: Model Serving Tier -->
    <g class="stack-diagram__card" transform="translate(25, 40)">
      <rect width="215" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="stack-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26">TIER 1: SERVING</text>
      <text class="stack-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">模型推理與託管</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="stack-diagram__subcard stack-diagram__subcard--indigo"></rect>
        <text
          class="stack-diagram__header stack-diagram__header--indigo"
          x="10"
          y="20">vLLM / TGI</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 多 GPU 張量平行 (TP)</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="58"
          >• PagedAttention 顯存管理</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="76"
          >• 生產級 OpenAI 相容 API</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 170)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="80"
          rx="6"
          class="stack-diagram__subcard stack-diagram__subcard--blue"></rect>
        <text
          class="stack-diagram__header stack-diagram__header--blue"
          x="10"
          y="20">Ollama / llama.cpp</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• GGUF 量化本機輕量部署</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 邊緣端與開發者本機推薦</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 260)">
        <rect width="187" height="85" rx="6" class="stack-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="stack-diagram__header" x="10" y="20">開放權重生態</text>
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• Llama 3 / Qwen 2.5 / DeepSeek</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• AWQ / GPTQ / FP8 量化加速</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 2: Vector & Storage Tier -->
    <g class="stack-diagram__card" transform="translate(255, 40)">
      <rect width="215" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="stack-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26"
        >TIER 2: VECTOR &amp; MEMORY</text
      >
      <text class="stack-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">向量檢索與知識儲存</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="stack-diagram__subcard stack-diagram__subcard--pink"></rect>
        <text
          class="stack-diagram__header stack-diagram__header--pink"
          x="10"
          y="20">Qdrant / Milvus</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 億級向量 HNSW 索引</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• Hybrid 混合檢索 (BM25)</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="78"
          >• Payload Metadata 過濾</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 170)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="80"
          rx="6"
          class="stack-diagram__subcard stack-diagram__subcard--purple"></rect>
        <text
          class="stack-diagram__header stack-diagram__header--purple"
          x="10"
          y="20">pgvector / Chroma</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 結合關聯式 SQL 事務</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60">• 零新技術棧負擔</text>
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 260)">
        <rect width="187" height="85" rx="6" class="stack-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="stack-diagram__header" x="10" y="20"
          >嵌入模型 (Embedding)</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• BGE-M3 / Nomic Embed</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 多語言與長文本支援</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 3: Orchestration Tier -->
    <g class="stack-diagram__card" transform="translate(485, 40)">
      <rect width="215" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="stack-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26"
        >TIER 3: ORCHESTRATION</text
      >
      <text class="stack-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">工作流與 Agent 編排</text
      >

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="stack-diagram__subcard stack-diagram__subcard--cyan"></rect>
        <text
          class="stack-diagram__header stack-diagram__header--cyan"
          x="10"
          y="20">LangGraph / LlamaIndex</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• 狀態圖 (StateGraph) 控制</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 循環分支與 Human-in-Loop</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="78"
          >• 高級 RAG (Rerank / Chunking)</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 170)">
        <rect
          width="187"
          height="80"
          rx="6"
          class="stack-diagram__subcard stack-diagram__subcard--teal"></rect>
        <text
          class="stack-diagram__header stack-diagram__header--teal"
          x="10"
          y="20">多 Agent 協作框架</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• AutoGen / CrewAI</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 角色分工與訊息總線</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 260)">
        <rect width="187" height="85" rx="6" class="stack-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="stack-diagram__header" x="10" y="20">MCP 協議生態</text>
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• Model Context Protocol</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• 標準化工具與數據源對接</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Column 4: Observability & Eval Tier -->
    <g class="stack-diagram__card" transform="translate(715, 40)">
      <rect width="220" height="370" rx="12"></rect>
      <text class="stack-diagram__badge" x="14" y="26"
        >TIER 4: OBSERVABILITY</text
      >
      <text class="stack-diagram__title" x="14" y="54">評測與鏈路追蹤</text>

      <g transform="translate(14, 75)">
        <rect
          width="192"
          height="85"
          rx="6"
          class="stack-diagram__subcard stack-diagram__subcard--gold"></rect>
        <text
          class="stack-diagram__header stack-diagram__header--gold"
          x="10"
          y="20">Langfuse / Phoenix</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• OpenTelemetry 鏈路追蹤</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• Token 成本與延遲瀑布圖</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="78"
          >• 用戶反饋 Score 閉環</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 170)">
        <rect
          width="192"
          height="80"
          rx="6"
          class="stack-diagram__subcard stack-diagram__subcard--green"></rect>
        <text
          class="stack-diagram__header stack-diagram__header--green"
          x="10"
          y="20">RAG 幻覺自動評測</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40">• Ragas / DeepEval</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• Context Relevance 相關性</text
        >
      </g>

      <g transform="translate(14, 260)">
        <rect width="192" height="85" rx="6" class="stack-diagram__subcard"
        ></rect>
        <text class="stack-diagram__header" x="10" y="20"
          >防護欄 (Guardrails)</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="40"
          >• NeMo Guardrails / Guardrails AI</text
        >
        <text class="stack-diagram__desc" x="10" y="60"
          >• Prompt Injection 注入防禦</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile View -->
  <div class="stack-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="stack-mobile-card stack-mobile-card--indigo">
      <span class="stack-mobile-badge stack-mobile-badge--indigo"
        >TIER 1: SERVING</span
      >
      <h4>1. 模型推理層 (vLLM / Ollama)</h4>
      <p>
        支援多 GPU 張量平行與 PagedAttention 顯存管理，提供高吞吐、低延遲的
        OpenAI 相容服務。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="stack-mobile-card stack-mobile-card--pink">
      <span class="stack-mobile-badge stack-mobile-badge--pink"
        >TIER 2: VECTOR</span
      >
      <h4>2. 向量檢索層 (Qdrant / Milvus)</h4>
      <p>
        億級 HNSW 索引與 BM25 混合檢索，為 Agent 與 RAG
        提供精確知識召回與語義記憶。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="stack-mobile-card stack-mobile-card--cyan">
      <span class="stack-mobile-badge stack-mobile-badge--cyan"
        >TIER 3: ORCHESTRATION</span
      >
      <h4>3. 工作流編排 (LangGraph / MCP)</h4>
      <p>
        基於狀態圖（StateGraph）構建循環 Agent、工具調用沙盒與多智能體協同。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="stack-mobile-card stack-mobile-card--gold">
      <span class="stack-mobile-badge stack-mobile-badge--gold"
        >TIER 4: OBSERVABILITY</span
      >
      <h4>4. 可觀測與評測 (Langfuse / Ragas)</h4>
      <p>
        OTel 全鏈路追蹤 Token 消耗與延遲瀑布圖，透過 RAG Triad
        自動評測防禦幻覺。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="stack-caption" class="stack-diagram__caption">
    圖 3：企業端到端開源 AI 技術棧四大核心層級全景架構
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .stack-diagram {
    margin: 2rem 0;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .stack-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .stack-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  .stack-diagram__caption {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
  }

  .stack-diagram__card rect {
    fill: var(--dg-surface-2);
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .stack-diagram__card rect {
    fill: #0f172a;
    stroke: #1e293b;
  }

  .stack-diagram__badge {
    font-family:
      ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .stack-diagram__badge {
    fill: #94a3b8;
  }

  .stack-diagram__title {
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    fill: var(--dg-ink);
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .stack-diagram__title {
    fill: #f8fafc;
  }

  .stack-diagram__subcard {
    fill: #ffffff;
    stroke: var(--dg-rule);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .stack-diagram__subcard {
